    "Image 1 numbers the SWD wires 1 GND, 2 SWDIO, 3 SWCLK, 4 3V3, but its traces land on pads in physical order GND, SWCLK, SWDIO, 3V3 (left to right). I treated those numbers as wiring-list indices (kept as functions) and ordered physically from the USB end; image 2 numbers the same pads 1 3V3 ... 4 GND."
  ],
  "notes": "Image 1 is a wiring diagram with a nanoDAP v2.3 debugger (separate product, not transcribed); the BastWAN side headers in image 1 are unlabeled and skipped. Skipped SMA antenna, JST battery connector, micro-USB and reset button."
